      <data key="d7" xml:space="preserve"/>
      <data key="d8" xml:space="preserve"><![CDATA[Mitochondrial solute transporter which transports branched-chain amino acid (BCAA; valine, leucine and isoleucine) into mitochondria in brown adipose tissue (BAT). BAT is involved in BCAA catabolism and actively utilizes BCAA in the mitochondria for thermogenesis]]></data>
